trol over Tyrol’s copper and silver mines. Of revenues from those mines, 50 percent would go to the Fuggers, 18 percent to Maximilian, and 32 percent to the mining contractor.”'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1920, 'temperature': 0.2})
